moves.experience:
• The cursor is Klein's living brush. Moving it lays down a fluid International Klein Blue pigment over the whole page. It swirls with the motion and dissipates in about 1.5s.
• One difference-blend layer recolours everything under the pigment:
  – paper → IKB #042AE3;
  – ink → gold #D4AF10 (4.06:1 on that blue, so text stays readable);
  – over the black Instances stage: gold fields with blue type;
  – over the IKB colophon and case sheet: Monogold #D4AF37 with near-black #0B0C27 type (9.1:1).
• Edges are powdery, not smoky, so it reads as dry pigment.
• Run the brush across 4BOOSER and the name turns gold on blue: the hero money shot.
